  "premise": "Hours before a civic-tech nonprofit unveils a grant-tracking platform, its auditor Mara Voss disappears and a crucial evidence package vanishes. Investigators must follow public project pages, event records, a press archive, and a mirrored storage portal to prove that the nonprofit's operations director diverted restoration funds and staged a server failure to erase the audit trail.",
  "experienceGoals": [
    "Follow a clear chain of public online evidence from an accessible missing-person lead to a financial conspiracy.",
    "Resolve contradictions among schedules, access records, procurement notices, and public statements.",
    "Experience escalating stakes while using believable archives, databases, mailboxes, and evidence-report interfaces.",
    "Reach a decisive, non-graphic conclusion grounded entirely in fictional project-hosted content."
  ],
